REQUIREMENTS:

	Patched core/rc package.

PRECAUTION:

	Don't forget to patch rc.
	with:

	# patch -d / -p 1 lvm2-rc.patch

PRE-INSTALL:

	Patch rc:
	# patch -d / -p 1 lvm2-rc.patch

POST-INSTALL:

PRE-REMOVE:

	remove patch or reinstall the rc port and run rejmerge

	# patch -R -d / -p 1 lvm2-rc.patch

POST-REMOVE:

NOTES:

